                    <p class="pika-ci-body-text">
                        Evaluating customer value only through total spend can hide important parts of customer behavior.
                    </p>
                    <p class="pika-ci-body-text">
                        A customer who purchases consistently over time and a customer who made one high-value purchase do not represent the same commercial context.
                    </p>
                    <p class="pika-ci-body-text">
                        Pika evaluates calculated customer-value indicators together with purchase frequency and behavioral context.
                    </p>
                    <p class="pika-ci-body-text">
                        This calculated context helps teams evaluate which customers may require closer attention or which customer groups may call for a different marketing approach.
                    </p>
                    <div class="pika-ci-closing-manifesto">
                        Customer value is not merely a label.<br />
                        It is context for decision making.
                    </div>
                </div>
            }
        </div>
    </section>

